    <string name="disclosure_title">Before you turn this on</string>
    <string name="disclosure_message">The service reads the WOLF screen and carries out commands inside WOLF only.\n\nTo know when to wait, it checks the name of the app in front. It does not read, tap or type in any other app.\n\nIf Android shows its own "WOLF isn\'t responding" dialog, the service reads that dialog and can close it, then reopens WOLF.\n\nThe app does not save chat text.\n\nThe app sends no data to the internet.</string>
